  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0010_rival_04",
      "hash": "53625bfae0fb9c85",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「打擾了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0010_rival_05",
      "hash": "53625afae0fb9ad2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "喂～[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！\\n我上去囉！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0010_rival_01",
      "hash": "536256fae0fb9406",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「[VAR TRNAME(0000)]，早啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0010_rival_08",
      "hash": "53625ffae0fba351",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……怎麼了？\\n看[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳一臉搞不清楚狀況的表情……"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0010_rival_02",
      "hash": "536255fae0fb9253",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我實在等不及了，\\n所以就來接[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳啦！\\c\\n今天終於來了！\\n我們總算可以……\\c\\n從大木博士那裡\\n拿到寶可夢，\\r\\n變成[VAR COLOR(0006)]訓練家[VAR COLOR(0000)]啦！\\c\\n我們快去找大木博士吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0010_rival_06",
      "hash": "536259fae0fb991f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊，但是在那之前……"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0010_rival_07",
      "hash": "536258fae0fb976c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我昨天寄了封郵件給[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳！\\c\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳要是還沒看的話，\\n記得去看一下喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0010_rival_03",
      "hash": "536254fae0fb90a0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那我就先到\\n大木博士的研究所等[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳了！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
